Yardkit
=======

This library is derived from "Saltline", a single-file browser FPS built as a
claude.ai artifact. The original artifact was distributed without a license
statement. Geometry parameters, naming conventions, shader ideas and decal
designs were extracted from that source and reorganised into this reusable
toolkit.

- Original work: Saltline (single-file browser FPS). Author and license: unknown.
- Extraction and the code in this repository: Copyright (c) 2026 wuxiangru915,
  released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
- Bundled `vendor/three`: three.js r180, MIT License, Copyright three.js authors.

If you are the author of the original work and want attribution changed or
this repository taken down, please open an issue.

No third-party images, fonts, or audio are included. All materials are
procedural GLSL; all models are generated from primitives at runtime.
